    <briefdescription>
<para>Operator struct template to check if an expression does not throw any exception. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This struct checks whether invoking the given callable completes without throwing an exception. The check is performed at construction time, with the result cached for reporting and composition. Use this when a test must verify that an operation is exception-safe.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>Callable_T</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The type of the callable object to be invoked. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
